  "description": "An issue was discovered in vsDesk v14.0101. An authenticated attacker with administrative privileges can bypass client-side file validation in the \"Import via CSV\" component due to a lack of server-side validation. This allows the upload of an arbitrary file, which can lead to Remote Code Execution (RCE) within the context of the web application.\u00a0\nApply patch from vendor  https://vsdesk.ru/ . Versions 14.0402 and on have the patch.",
